<view class="page">
  <view class="login-intro"><view class="eyebrow">ANDREW'S DENTAL</view><view class="title"><view>你好，欢迎来到</view><view>你的微笑照护空间。</view></view><view class="muted">登录后为本人预约，安排更从容。</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="login-tabs"><view class="{{mode === 'login' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="login" bindtap="mode">账号登录</view><view class="{{mode === 'register' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="register" bindtap="mode">建立账号</view></view>
    <text class="label">账号</text><input class="input" value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入登录账号" maxlength="80" disabled="{{busy}}" />
    <text class="label">密码</text><input class="input" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input" password placeholder="输入账号密码" maxlength="128" disabled="{{busy}}" />
    <block wx:if="{{mode === 'register'}}"><view class="muted space">账号支持字母、数字、点、下划线与短横线，3 至 80 位；密码至少 12 位。联系电话可供家庭成员共用，不能据此认领他人档案。</view><patient-form value="{{profile}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="profileChange" /></block>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error space">{{error}}</view><button class="primary space" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{mode === 'login' ? '登录账号' : '注册并登录'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在准备登录…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{config.demoLoginEnabled}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">演示体验账号</view><view class="muted">以下为虚构患者的演示账号，仅供体验预约流程。请勿输入真实医疗信息。</view><block wx:for="{{config.demoAccounts}}" wx:key="username"><button wx:if="{{item.portal === 'patient'}}" class="secondary space" data-username="{{item.username}}" bindtap="demo" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.displayName}} · 演示登录</button></block></view>
  <view class="footer-note">请妥善保管账号信息，预约记录仅本人可查看。</view>
</view>
